shadowbaritone.command.follow.short_desc=跟随实体
shadowbaritone.command.follow.long_desc.1=follow 命令会让 Baritone 跟随特定类型的实体。
shadowbaritone.command.follow.long_desc.usage=用法：
shadowbaritone.command.follow.long_desc.example.entities=> follow entities - 跟随所有实体。
shadowbaritone.command.follow.long_desc.example.entity=> follow entity <entity1> <entity2> <...> - 跟随指定实体类型（例如 skeleton、horse 等）
shadowbaritone.command.follow.long_desc.example.players=> follow players - 跟随玩家
shadowbaritone.command.follow.long_desc.example.player=> follow player <username1> <username2> <...> - 跟随指定玩家
